<div class="reason-grid">
<article class="reason reveal"><div class="reason-num">01</div><span class="reason-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M24 5V43 M5 24H43 M10.5 10.5L37.5 37.5 M37.5 10.5L10.5 37.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/></svg></span><h3>Olhar para dentro</h3><p>Reconhecer e acolher partes de si que ainda pedem compreensão.</p></article>
